(and every man who buys real estate on payments, if their object when) Tj T*
(buying is to sell at a profit.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is highly probable that these contentions will be vigorously) Tj T*
(attacked, on the theory that more evil than good results from) Tj T*
(speculative ventures, and that therefore the whole structure should) Tj T*
(be razed on a ?greatest good to the greatest number? basis; but aside) Tj T*
