(at all probable that any such thing can be effected unless human) Tj T*
(nature undergoes a radical change. Tear down every stock exchange in) Tj T*
(the United States tomorrow, and people will be speculating, a majority) Tj T*
(of them foolishly, in another week. The cure lies not in paternalism,) Tj T*
(but in evolution and understanding. As has been said, more has been) Tj T*
(accomplished in recent years by the educational crusade of the press) Tj T*
(than by all the rantings and warnings of a century. We have our) Tj T*
(periods of reckless over-indulgence, it is true, but the evil is) Tj T*
