(In 1864, came a crash in speculative prices following tremendous) Tj T*
(inflation. Between April, 1864, and April, 1865, leading stocks) Tj T*
(declined from $50 to $100 per share. As the inflation of this period) Tj T*
(was caused largely by the high prices of commodities and greatly) Tj T*
