(the latter half of December and June and an advance early in January) Tj T*
(and July. While this reasoning looks sound enough on its face, it is) Tj T*
(not at all dependable. It is certain that everything is discounted in) Tj T*
(advance of actual events in speculative circles, and the more widely) Tj T*
(such theories as the one mentioned are disseminated, the more dangerous) Tj T*
(and inoperative they become. Instances are not lacking in recent) Tj T*
