(?The new methods and the new projects are going through the test of) Tj T*
(fire today, and some of them are being consumed. The tests which weeded) Tj T*
(out the badly organized and incompetent of the early stock companies,) Tj T*
(which drove to the wall the ?wildcat? banks of ante-bellum days, and) Tj T*
(which wiped out dividends and stock rights in badly managed railways,) Tj T*
(are now being applied to the new forms of organization which have been) Tj T*
(the growth of the past decade. But the stronger and better organized) Tj T*
(of these new corporations are likely to meet these trials without) Tj T*
(disaster, or to modify their methods to conform to the teachings of) Tj T*
(experience, until there remains to the financial world a valuable) Tj T*
(residuum of new methods for giving flexibility to capital and promoting) Tj T*
(its transfer promptly and efficiently from the industries where it is) Tj T*
(not needed to those where it will render its highest service.?--From) Tj T*
(?Wall Street and the Country,? by Chas. A. Conant.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
