(    ?As simple as this illustration may appear, it is) Tj T*
(    worthy of most earnest consideration. True, the) Tj T*
(    upward and downward movements show opportunities) Tj T*
(    on both sides, but if the _purchaser_ makes a) Tj T*
(    mistake, as all speculators will, he is hopelessly) Tj T*
(    involved. If he buys at the wrong point he will) Tj T*
(    never see daylight during the progress of the) Tj T*
(    movement. Look at the other side of the matter.) Tj T*
(    The _seller_ cannot make a mistake. No matter) Tj T*
