() Tj T*
(The writer?s reply to this question consists principally of a summing) Tj T*
(up of points already covered in other portions of this work. It is) Tj T*
(necessary to study and understand the subject thoroughly, to know) Tj T*
(values, general conditions, the technical position of shares, and) Tj T*
(above all things to consult future probabilities rather than past) Tj T*
(performances. Study of the past has its educational value and this is) Tj T*
