(As to the best side of the market for operations, it is thought that) Tj T*
(the long side offers the greatest opportunities. The long side is) Tj T*
(healthier, it is constructive, and almost all the great fortunes made) Tj T*
(in the market have been founded on discreet and well-timed purchases.) Tj T*
(To adhere to this plan, however, frequently requires long periods of) Tj T*
(non-participation, and speculators are not, as a class, very patient.) Tj T*
(The man who can so school himself as to await opportunities to purchase) Tj T*
(good securities at low prices has by far the best of the bargain. Few) Tj T*
(men can do it.) Tj T*
