(It is fully realized that a work which defends stock speculation in) Tj T*
(any degree, will meet with much criticism. Nevertheless, people _will_) Tj T*
(speculate and if you are one of those who will--do it right.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is submitted in concluding this work that if the advice here given) Tj T*
(is heeded, i.e., to know _what_ you are buying and _why_; to buy only) Tj T*
(_good_ properties when prices are depressed; to exercise patience and) Tj T*
(provide sufficient capital; to eliminate first and forever the idea) Tj T*
(that correct deductions mean sudden riches; to use brains instead) Tj T*
(of charts, and common-sense instead of tips; in short, to apply) Tj T*
(to speculative ventures the same degree of business foresight and) Tj T*
(understanding as would be employed in any other business, the evils and) Tj T*
(losses which have always been a part of speculative history, would be) Tj T*
(diminished if not eliminated.) Tj T*
